e balcony overlooking the vibrant community. Thoughtfully designed interiors and premium finishes create a sophisticated yet comfortable living environment.<br><br><br>&nbsp As part of the exclusive Palace Residences collection, residents enjoy a five-star lifestyle inspired by world-class hospitality, with direct access to Dubai Creek Harbour's waterfront promenade, marina, retail destinations, and fine dining experiences.<br><br>Property Features<br><br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp1 Spacious Bedroom <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp2 Modern Bathroom <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspFully Furnished <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspVacant &amp; Ready to Move In <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspPrivate Balcony <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspOpen-Plan Living &amp; Dining Area <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspContemporary Kitchen with Built-in Appliances <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspDedicated Laundry Room <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspBuilt-in Wardrobes <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspPremium Finishes <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp1 Allocated Covered Parking Space <br><br>World-Class Amenities<br><br>&nbsp<br>&nbspInfinity Swimming Pool <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspFully Equipped Gymnasium <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspLandscaped Leisure Areas <br>&nbsp<br>&nbsp24/7 Security <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspConcierge Services <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspValet Parking <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspChildren's Play Area <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspWaterfront Promenade <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspCreek Marina <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspRetail Outlets, Cafés &amp; Restaurants <br><br>Prime Location<br><br>&nbsp Ideally located within Dubai Creek Harbour, residents enjoy seamless access to Dubai's major business and lifestyle destinations.<br><br><br>&nbsp<br>&nbspDowntown Dubai &amp; Burj Khalifa – 10 Minutes <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspDubai International Airport – 15 Minutes <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspBusiness Bay – 15 Minutes <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspDIFC – 15 Minutes <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspRas Al Khor Wildlife Sanctuary – 5 Minutes <br>&nbsp<br>&nbspDubai Festival City – 10 Minutes <br><br><br>&nbsp Palace Residences offers an exceptional waterfront lifestyle, combining elegant branded residences, outstanding amenities, and the vibrant atmosphere of Dubai Creek Harbour. Whether relaxing by the marina or enjoying the community's world-class facilities, this residence delivers an unparalleled living experience.<br><br><br>&nbsp Offered for Rent: AED 110,000 per annum.<br><br><br>&nbsp Contact Provident Real Estate today to arrange your private viewing.<br>","longitude":null,"negotiator_id":"11966","negotiator_mapping":"liberty@providentestate.com","parking":["1"],"price":110000,"price_qualifier":null,"publish":1,"search_type":"lettings","slug":"1-bedroom-apartment-to-rent-in-palace-residences-dubai-creek-harbour-the-lagoons-dubai","status":"To Let","thumbnail":"http://provident-bx-upload-eu.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/iblock/338/3382c6e8721c50a9def6710fd3e00a02/WhatsApp-Image-2026_07_14-at-11.43.13-_1_.jpg","title":"1 bedroom apartment to rent","extra":{"views":"","cheques":"2","project":null,"bitrix_id":"1478595","furnished":"Furnished","permit_number":"71238637478","rental_period":"Yearly","current_status":"","furnishing_type":"Furnished","completion_status":"completed","property_condition":"","property_managed_by_us":""},"video_tour":[],"virtual_tour":[],"qr_code":null,"premium":0,"link_to_employee":{"id":"11966","url":"https://storage.googleapis.com/prov-email-signatures/Liberty-Dudzayi-PFB.jpg","name":"Liberty Dudzayi","email":"liberty@providentestate.com","phone":"+971 56 219 4574","brn_number":"50887"},"developer":"","ggfx_results":[{"id":5835208,"src_cftle":"i/property/PS-06022615/crm_negotiator_id/prov-email-signatures/Liberty-Dudzayi-PFB.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/property/PS-06022615/crm_negotiator_id/prov-email-signatures/60t70/Liberty-Dudzayi-PFB.webp","alias":"crm_negotiator_id_image","format":"webp","transform":"60t70","created_at":"2026-02-13 20:49:35.447","updated_at":"2026-02-13 20:49:35.447"}],"created_at":"2026-02-13T20:49:35.447Z","updated_at":"2026-02-13T20:49:35.447Z","created_by_id":null,"updated_by_id":null,"src_ur